    ; unit gets, and `console` — the first name anyone tries — is TS2584 and not
    ; TS2304. ★A message chosen by the CALLER and consumed three functions down is
    ; exactly the shape §3.5ae names: a value that is invisible while the reader
    ; is a stop.
    ;
    ; ★ `UsesWildcardTypes()` is `slices.Contains(options.Types, "*")` and this
    ; port has no options record, so it is FALSE and each of its four forks takes
    ; the second, longer message. Written as the constant with the reading named,
    ; the way every other unset option in this file is.
