    ; getContextuallyTypedParameterType and getContextualThisParameterType —
    ; opened with `isContextSensitiveFunctionOrObjectLiteralMethod`, which
    ; admits only a function expression, an arrow function and an
    ; object-literal method: the three shapes this port stopped at in
    ; checkExpressionWorker. Porting the chapter is what gives the predicate an
    ; input, exactly as its own note predicted.
