    ; function rather than an index pair, because the recursion is the walk).
    ;
    ; ★★ THE ARM LIST IS A CLOSED SET AND IT IS THE REFERENCE'S: everything that
    ; is not a return statement and not one of the fifteen statement kinds that
    ; can CONTAIN one answers false without descending — which is what stops the
    ; walk at a nested function's boundary without a test for one.
    function for_each_return_statement_is_context_sensitive(this, node: ref[AstNode]) returns bool linked


























