    ; expression_of_type_0_can_t_be_used_to_index_type_1)`, which makes a NEW
    ; diagnostic carrying THAT code at the chained one's own loc and hangs the
    ; inner one off it as a MESSAGE CHAIN. All five inner diagnostics are on
    ; `accessExpression`, so code and span are the same whichever arm ran — and
    ; when none does, the nil path reports the same code on the same node. The
