    ; return — a bare `any` keyword node carrying a synthetic `/*elided*/` leading
    ; comment that the emit printer this dump goes through does not write. The
    ; reference's own baselines are the witness: `cyclicGenericTypeInstantiation`
    ; prints eleven nested `{ y2: … }` and then a plain `any`.
