    ; ★★ THE `this` AND JsxNamespacedName ARMS HAVE NO INPUT FROM EITHER CALLER —
    ; isEntityNameExpression admits an Identifier and a dotted chain of them and
    ; nothing else — and they are written anyway, because EntityNameToString is one
    ; function upstream and a caller that arrives with a JSX name must meet a text
    ; rather than a gap. The kinds that remain are the reference's own panic.
