    ; getDeclarationModifierFlagsFromSymbol, the isWrite-false form.
    ;
    ; ★★★ THE SYNTHETIC BRANCH WAS A REPORT UNTIL SLICE 151 AND ITS NOTE WAS AN
    ; EXPIRED ONE (§3.5eo). It read *a synthesized property is made by the
    ; union/intersection machinery, which nothing here builds* — slice 94 gave the
    ; port unions and the create_union_or_intersection_property machinery sets
    ; ContainsPublic/ContainsPrivate/ContainsStatic itself, which is what the branch
    ; reads. It is pure flag arithmetic over CheckFlags, needs nothing, and the
    ; second half of the note was the honest part: answering 0 LOSES a `static` and
    ; picks `public` over `protected`.
