    ; ★★★ THE GUARD IS THE WHOLE FUNCTION FOR EVERY ANNOTATED VARIABLE, and it now
    ; asks BOTH halves: upstream is `declaredType == autoType || declaredType ==
    ; autoArrayType`, and this port asked only the first while the body was a stop —
    ; a conjunct dropped for want of a reader, which is exactly the shape §3.5be
    ; means. The second half is what lets `var x = []` keep evolving after the first
    ; push has already widened it to `any[]`.
