    ; computeKeyPropertyNameAndMap, whole, plus the memo write.
    ;
    ; ★★★ THE THREE REFUSALS ARE A COST MODEL AND NOT A CORRECTNESS RULE, which is
    ; why the map is safe to be absent: fewer than ten constituents, a primitive
    ; union, or fewer than ten object-like constituents, and the reference answers
    ; *missing* — every reader then walks the union instead. So a wrong answer
    ; here is a wrong ANSWER (a map that selects the wrong constituent), never a
    ; missing one, which is what makes the duplicate sentinel load-bearing.
    procedure compute_key_property_name_and_map(mutable this, mutable t: ref[Type]) io reads checker_strict_null_checks linked


































