    ; containsUndefinedType. The union arm reads the FIRST constituent and nothing
    ; else, which is exact rather than an approximation: a union's constituents are
    ; sorted by CompareTypes, whose first key is the type FLAGS, and only Any
    ; (1 << 0) and Unknown (1 << 1) sort ahead of Undefined (1 << 2) — a union
    ; containing either of those is not a union at all, because getUnionTypeWorker
    ; answers `any` or `unknown` for it. So an undefined-carrying union carries it
    ; first.
    ;
    ; ★★★ THE ARM IS WRITTEN IN SLICE 94 AND THE LINE IT REPLACES NAMED ITS OWN
    ; EXPIRY DATE: *"No union is minted here, so the arm has no input either way"*.
    ; It has input now, and it is the input that decides the whole property-
    ; initialization row — `p: string` and `p: string | undefined` differ here and
    ; nowhere else.
    function contains_undefined_type(t: ref[Type]) returns bool linked



















    ; isDestructuringAssignmentTarget.
    ; isDestructuringAssignmentTarget.
    ;
    ; ★★★ IT EXISTED TWICE UNTIL SLICE 147 — ONCE AS A `this` METHOD AND ONCE AS A
    ; STATIC WITH THE SAME NAME AND THE SAME PARAMETER LIST — AND THE TWO MANGLED
    ; TO ONE SYMBOL. `nm` on the package object showed a single
    ; `_ZN7Checker34is_destructuring_assignment_targetER7AstNode`, because Scaly's
    ; Itanium mangling encodes neither the RECEIVER nor the implicit caller page:
    ; `f(this, x: T)` and `f(x: T)` are the same name. The emitter keeps ONE body,
    ; so one of the two call forms passes its first argument into the wrong slot —
    ; the static's `Checker.is_destructuring_assignment_target(parent)` handed
    ; `parent` where the surviving body wanted the receiver, and
    ; `AstNode.parent_node_of` answered `0x0a0000000a`, a SIGBUS three frames
    ; further on.
    ;
    ; ★★★ IT WAS LATENT FOR AS LONG AS THE STATIC'S ONE CALLER WAS UNREACHABLE:
    ; that caller is `check_identifier`'s spread-destructuring arm, which is
    ; entered only from inside a SpreadAssignment — and `check_object_literal`'s
    ; spread arm was a stop until this slice. **A stop hides a WRONG BINARY as
    ; readily as a wrong answer.** The sweep is three lines of Python over the
    ; package (same name, same parameter types, one with `this` and one without)
    ; and it reads ONE — this pair.
    ;
    ; ★ The STATIC is the form that stays: the function reads only the node.
    function is_destructuring_assignment_target(parent: ref[AstNode]) returns bool linked



















