    ; an intersection type is minted anywhere in this port, so neither list can be
    ; reached* — true when it was written and false in two steps: slice 94 gave
    ; the port unions, and slice 116 gave it one that reaches THIS function, since
    ; an enum's declared type is the union of its members'. The INTERSECTION half
    ; is unchanged and still stops, because nothing mints one.
