    ; ★★★ AND THAT LAST CLAUSE HAD EXPIRED TOO, in a way no instrument looks for:
    ; `get_intersection_type_ex` mints an intersection and has since slice 121, so
    ; *nothing mints one* was a statement about a producer that had arrived four
    ; chapters earlier. Slice 155 wrote the arm — two loops, no new callee. **A
    ; premise naming a PRODUCER ages exactly like a premise naming a callee, and
    ; `expiredstops.py` can only see the second kind.**
    ; someType with the type-PARAMETER predicate, slice 139 — the relation's
    ; comparability carve-out is its one caller. ★The someType family is spelled
    ; one function per predicate in this port (§3.18) and this is the cheapest
    ; member of it: a union asks its constituents, anything else asks itself.
    function some_type_is_type_parameter(t: ref[Type]) returns bool linked






















    procedure some_type_is_generic_with_union_constraint(mutable this, mutable t: ref[Type]) returns bool io reads checker_no_unchecked_indexed_access linked
























    ; isGenericTypeWithUnionConstraint — the INNER walk, whose own composite arm
