    ; resolveUntypedCall, whole for the two kinds that reach it.
    ;
    ; ★★ THE TYPE ARGUMENTS ARE CHECKED EVEN THOUGH THE CALL IS AN ERROR, which is
    ; the reference's own comment: "Check type arguments even though we will give an
    ; error that untyped calls may not accept type arguments. This gets us
    ; diagnostics for the type arguments and marks them as referenced." So the
    ; TS2347 above and this walk are not alternatives.
    ;
    ; ★ Its two other arms are rows, and each is unreachable for the reason its own
    ; caller is: a tagged template reaches resolveSignature through
