    ; ★★ THE STATIC-INITIALIZER MARKING LOOP IS NOT WRITTEN. It sets
    ; NodeCheckFlagsContainsSuperPropertyInStaticInitializer on every enclosing
    ; block-scope container, and the ONE reader of that bit is
    ; checkReflectCollision, which is a stop in this port
    ; (`check-reflect-collision`, at record_potential_collision_with_reflect_in_
    ; generated_code). A write with no reader is the shape §3.5be argues against —
    ; and it is invisible here only BECAUSE the reader reports, which is why the
    ; two lines are named rather than dropped in silence.
    procedure check_super_expression(mutable this, mutable node: ref[AstNode]) @page true @returnpage true returns ref[Type]? io reads ordinal_lock linked

















































































































































