    ; ── slice 124: compareSignaturesRelated ───────────────────────────────────
    ;
    ; ★★★ THE LARGEST UNPORTED FUNCTION IN relater.go (183 reference lines), and
    ; what stood on it is `get-signatures-of-symbol` — the frontier's row for
    ; TS2394, *this overload signature is not compatible with its implementation
