    ; `isSignatureAssignableTo` over this.
    ;
    ; ★★★ THREE PARAMETERS OF THE REFERENCE'S SEVEN ARE DROPPED AND EACH FOR A
    ; MEASURED REASON, not for brevity. `reportErrors` and `errorReporter` are
    ; FALSE and nil at the one caller this port has (isSignatureAssignableTo), and
    ; the reporter writes into the relater's error CHAIN, which this port has no
    ; writer for — so every `if reportErrors { errorReporter(...) }` here would be
