    ; draft recorded only on the answering path, and the `ctxsig` column then read
    ; **0 on every row of every fixture** — because a contextual signature that IS
    ; found sends the function to getReturnTypeFromBody, which stops, so the one
    ; population the column exists to separate could never reach the log. A pin
    ; whose most interesting column is a constant is slice 99's finding seven; the
    ; difference here is that it had a fix. `type_id` is 0 on a row that did not
    ; answer, which is what keeps the two readings apart.
