    ; ★★★ THE SUBSTITUTION ARM IS THE ONE THAT STAYS, and it is a genuine
    ; unreachable rather than a wall: nothing in this port mints a substitution
    ; type — getSubstitutionType has no caller here, the conditional's true branch
    ; does not narrow, and NoInfer is a chapter away — so its three callees
    ; (get_substitution_type, get_no_infer_type, get_restrictive_instantiation) are
    ; named rather than written.
    procedure instantiate_type_worker(mutable this, mutable t: ref[Type], mutable m: ref[TypeMapper], mutable alias_in: ref[TypeAlias]?) @page true @returnpage true returns ref[Type]? io reads checker_strict_null_checks linked
























































































































































































































































































